      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "In Milano",
        "use_content": true,
        "heading": "Every bed is made by the same two pairs of hands, from the first spring to the last stitch.",
        "text": "<p>Nothing is passed down a line. The two artisans who begin a bed finish it, and their names go with it. It is slower, and it is the reason the bed can come back to them at fifteen years and be made new.</p>"
      }
    },
    "s03": {
